    "markdown": "- **System Specifications:**\n  - Page size $= 100\\text{ bytes}$.\n  - Physical memory capacity $= 1\\text{ page frame}$.\n  - Loading rule: If address $x$ causes a page fault, the contiguous range $[x, x + 99]$ is loaded into the single page frame.\n  - Reference address sequence:\n    $$0100, 0200, 0430, 0499, 0510, 0530, 0560, 0120, 0220, 0240, 0260, 0320, 0410$$\n\n- **Step-by-Step Execution Trace:**\n  - 1. **$0100$:** Frame empty $\\implies$ **Page Fault 1**. Loads $[100, 199]$.\n  - 2. **$0200$:** Not in $[100, 199]$ $\\implies$ **Page Fault 2**. Loads $[200, 299]$.\n  - 3. **$0430$:** Not in $[200, 299]$ $\\implies$ **Page Fault 3**. Loads $[430, 529]$.\n  - 4. **$0499$:** Inside $[430, 529]$ $\\implies$ **Hit**.\n  - 5. **$0510$:** Inside $[430, 529]$ $\\implies$ **Hit**.\n  - 6. **$0530$:** $530 > 529$, not in frame $\\implies$ **Page Fault 4**. Loads $[530, 629]$.\n  - 7. **$0560$:** Inside $[530, 629]$ $\\implies$ **Hit**.\n  - 8. **$0120$:** Not in $[530, 629]$ $\\implies$ **Page Fault 5**. Loads $[120, 219]$.\n  - 9. **$0220$:** $220 > 219$, not in frame $\\implies$ **Page Fault 6**. Loads $[220, 319]$.\n  - 10. **$0240$:** Inside $[220, 319]$ $\\implies$ **Hit**.\n  - 11. **$0260$:** Inside $[220, 319]$ $\\implies$ **Hit**.\n  - 12. **$0320$:** $320 > 319$, not in frame $\\implies$ **Page Fault 7**. Loads $[320, 419]$.\n  - 13. **$0410$:** Inside $[320, 419]$ $\\implies$ **Hit**.\n\n- **Summary:**\n  - Total references $= 13$. Hits $= 6$. Page faults $= 7$.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is **Option C ($7$)**.",
